# Adapted from Aurum's chapter aurum-druid/ruins-of-lordaeron (Aurums Night Elf Druid Guide 0.4.37,
# GPL-3.0), as 06-ruines-de-lordaeron.guide was. Same sources: Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons
# codex, the dungeon boss by boss after Wowhead Forever's Ruins of Lordaeron guide and quest comments
# (read on 2026-11-08), rewritten; the door from Polestar 0.4.2.2's data/dungeon-runs.json (Tirisfal
# 63.2,67.5, players' recordings), the boat loop Auberdine - Menethil Harbor - Southshore from its
# travel data (TaxiPath 11167). Not played in game yet; the Alliance's way in is to check in game
# (Polestar's codex lists the dungeon in the Undercity, while its quests are Alliance-only).
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's route: the Groupe Alliance module offers it once the last
# Auberdine stop of forever/alliance/03-darkshore is done (Cave Mushrooms, 947, Tharnariun's Hope,
# 2139, handed in; Onu, 948, taken), about level 19, where the route boards the boat to Menethil
# Harbor. The same boat goes on to Southshore: the chapter gets off there, runs the Ruins and comes
# back by boat to Menethil Harbor, where the route's Loch Modan guide starts. The rewards are in
# Stormwind, which that guide reaches at about 20: the chapter's tab stays open until they are
# handed in (Polestar lists a ready quest's hand-in when its giver is on the player's map).
# Since 0.13.0 the chapter has the id its guide had up to 0.12.x (groupe-alliance/06-ruines-de-lordaeron): a tab saved on it opens
# the chapter.
# Polestar has no Alliance run here (its run is the Horde's): nothing of its own to compare but the
# door and the boat.
guide groupe-alliance/06-ruines-de-lordaeron
title Dungeon · Ruins of Lordaeron (17-22)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 17-22
zone Tirisfal Glades

step Auberdine: the boat to Southshore
  zone Darkshore
  tip Ruins of Lordaeron: a 5-player Forever dungeon in Tirisfal Glades, levels 15 to 22 in the group finder: at 18 or more it goes well. The boat for Menethil Harbor goes on to Southshore: stay aboard at Menethil.
  note Keep 5 free quest log slots. Horde land past Southshore: travel together.
  goto 32.4,43.8 "Boat to Southshore"

step Southshore
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Off the boat, the flight master stands by the inn: take the flight path, then sell and repair.
  getfp "Southshore"
  vendor nearest optional

step Ruins of Lordaeron entrance
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Horde land, on foot, at about level 20: keep together, clear of the roads and of Tarren Mill, whose guards are far above that level. North past Hillsbrad Fields, round Dalaran, then swim north up Lordamere Lake into Tirisfal and follow the road to the ruined capital: a long way on foot. The entrance's exact place is to check in game: the arrow leads to the data's point. A death inside sends the spirit to the healer right outside the dungeon.
  goto 63.2,67.5 "Ruins of Lordaeron" r 25

step Captain Truman
  tip On the left just after the portal. The bosses can be done in any order. Any undead may drop a Bloodied Insignia: right-click it, then keep looting them, there are plenty for everyone.
  note Share each quest with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  accept 95250                                -- Captain Truman
  accept 95195 item 268535 optional           -- Bloodied Insignia, from any undead: right-click it

step Witherfang
  tip The spider wing, King's Alley. Witherfang patrols with two spiders: kill them first and cleanse Leech Poison off the tank. Spider packs patrol too: pull with care.
  kill 250483                                 -- Witherfang

step The Baron
  tip Right from the entrance. Skeletons and banshees guard him; the banshees silence, so stun the packs. His head drops for everyone on the quest. The crypt door with a banshee in front of him is one of the Crest's spots.
  collect 268518 quest 95250                  -- Head of the Baron
  kill 250660                                 -- The Baron

step Lordamere Overlook: Viktor the Vile (optional)
  tip Flesh Golems hit hard and knock you into other packs; ghouls come in threes and fours. Viktor is optional: light the chimney of the ruined house in the south-west, survive 4 to 6 waves (leave the last enemy of each wave alive a moment so casters can drink), then he jumps out. Short group? Skip him.
  task "Viktor the Vile, or skipped"

step Market Street: The Abandoned (optional)
  tip The statue with green eyes starts 3 waves, and the skeleton mage in the south corridor must die too; then The Abandoned: Frost Nova, slows melee, drains the tank. Optional. The top of the west tower next to it is one of the Crest's spots.
  task "The Abandoned, or skipped"

step The Crest of Lordaeron
  tip One crest per run, at a random spot with no mark on the minimap: the top of the east tower (left of the top floor doors), the banshee crypt door before The Baron, the top of the west tower, the foot of the north-west tower by the double stairs, or the wall of Bjork's gazebo (nearly invisible: hover the wall).
  task "The Crest: clicked, or not found"
  accept 95189 optional                       -- Crest of Lordaeron: each player clicks it

step Bjork
  tip The undead troll patrolling the north-west: a simple fight, just wait out his short Anti-Magic Shield.
  kill 256097                                 -- Bjork

step Rath'mael
  tip The graveyard at the back. His one spell, Flamestrike, lands where the tank stood when he began it: step out at once, or stun him to stop it. The rare Lordaeron Captain is friendly to the Alliance: leave him be.
  kill 250657                                 -- Rath'mael
  collect 268540 x10 quest 95195              -- Bloodied Insignia, from the undead all run long
  accept 92415 optional                       -- Blood-stained letter, by Rath'mael: each player clicks their own

step Captain Truman: Abominable Creatures
  tip Back to the entrance on the way out: Captain Truman takes the Baron's head.
  turnin 95250                                -- Captain Truman, by the entrance

step Southshore: the boat to Menethil Harbor
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Back south to Southshore by the way you came. The boat calls at Auberdine, then Menethil Harbor: get off at Menethil, where the route's next guide starts (Loch Modan).
  goto 50.7,70.4 "Boat to Menethil Harbor"
  note Back to the route: click its tab now. This tab stays open for the three Stormwind rewards: the route reaches Stormwind at about 20, by the Deeprun Tram, and Polestar lists the hand-ins once there; this tab closes when they are in.

step Stormwind rewards
  zone Stormwind City
  tip General Marcus Jonathan stands at the city gate, Orphan Matron Nightingale in the orphanage, Lady Dena Kennedy in the keep. The Matron gives the next letter, for Darkshire in Duskwood: the route stops there at about 25.
  turnin 95195                                -- General Marcus Jonathan
  turnin 92415                                -- Orphan Matron Nightingale
  accept 95161 optional                       -- For Avette Fellwood in Darkshire
  turnin 95189                                -- Lady Dena Kennedy
